<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - E.W. Scripps started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - E.W. Scripps started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities Inc said it initiated coverage of E.W. Scripps Co as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- expects E.W. Scripps to earn $1.60 a share in 1997.</p>
<p>-- said E.W. Scripps remains among the least expensive media stocks.</p>
<p>-- set 1997 and 1998 price targets of $40.50 and $44.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- E.W. Scripps gained 1/4 to 37-1/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
